{"id":"ce269af4e544b5ee","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-qml-validity-sets.md","title":"Always Provable and Always True QML Sets","display":"df-qml-validity-sets — Always Provable and Always True QML Sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-qml-validity-sets","aliases":["89-df-qml-validity-sets"],"display":"df-qml-validity-sets — Always Provable and Always True QML Sets","depends_on":["[[89-df-qml-realization]]","[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-semantics]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-qml-validity-sets"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-qml-validity-sets</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-qml-validity-sets — Always Provable and Always True QML Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee07d81809d76030\" href=\"?note=ee07d81809d76030\" title=\"89-df-qml-realization\">89-df-qml-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8811191242063297\" href=\"?note=8811191242063297\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-semantics\">89-df-arithmetical-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_Q\">\\(g_Q\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"15c083801acd41a1\" href=\"?note=15c083801acd41a1\" title=\"89-df-qml-formula\">89-df-qml-formula</a> 的编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\">\\(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pred}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Pred}(S)\\)</span> 有限。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^Q_r\">\\(\\tau^Q_r\\)</span> 按已定义递归仅在谓词支集包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(r)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(r)\\)</span> 的公式上使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_Q(S)\">\\(\\mathcal R_Q(S)\\)</span> 包含全部合法有限实现，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 在无关谓词上给值。</li>\n<li>仍保留原实现条件“自由变元恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\">\\(v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\)</span>”；标准算术真值采用本书递归满足关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}validity\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_Q(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{r:\\mathrm{Pred}(S)\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\mid\n\\forall P_i^{(k)}\\in\\mathrm{Pred}(S)\\ \\mathrm{FV}(r(P_i^{(k)}))=\\{v_j\\mid j&lt;k\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AP}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_Q(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q,\\ \\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Q(S)\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau^Q_r(S))\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AT}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_Q(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q,\\ \\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Q(S)\\\n(\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^Q_r(S))\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal V&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ \\mathbb N\\models A\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}validity\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_Q(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{r:\\mathrm{Pred}(S)\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\mid\n\\forall P_i^{(k)}\\in\\mathrm{Pred}(S)\\ \\mathrm{FV}(r(P_i^{(k)}))=\\{v_j\\mid j&lt;k\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AP}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_Q(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q,\\ \\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Q(S)\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau^Q_r(S))\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AT}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_Q(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q,\\ \\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Q(S)\\\n(\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^Q_r(S))\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal V&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ \\mathbb N\\models A\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 17 章，印刷页 220,233–239；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n两者是自然数码集合；非合法句子码不属于任何一个。有限实现可有效枚举而整体全称量化是无限的。对象 PA 定理性、外部标准真与句子码集合属于三个不同层次。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-qml-realization","status":"resolved","id":"ee07d81809d76030","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"8811191242063297","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-qml-formula","status":"resolved","id":"15c083801acd41a1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$g_Q$ 是 [[89-df-qml-formula]] 的编码；$S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q$。$\\mathrm{Pred}(S)$ 有限。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g_Q","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pred}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau^Q_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_Q(S)","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}validity\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_Q(S)&\\coloneqq\\{r:\\mathrm{Pred}(S)\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\mid\n\\forall P_i^{(k)}\\in\\mathrm{Pred}(S)\\ \\mathrm{FV}(r(P_i^{(k)}))=\\{v_j\\mid j<k\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AP}_Q&\\coloneqq\\{g_Q(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q,\\ \\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Q(S)\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau^Q_r(S))\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AT}_Q&\\coloneqq\\{g_Q(S)\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q,\\ \\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Q(S)\\\n(\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^Q_r(S))\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal V&\\coloneqq\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ \\mathbb N\\models A\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1908,"backlinks":[{"id":"73653f2b36e4ca9d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4e0f03a34c592870","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-validity-sets]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-205","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-formula]] → [[89-df-open-provability-formula]] → [[89-df-qml-realization]] → [[89-df-qml-validity-sets]] → [[89-df-relative-completeness]] → [[89-thm-qml-complexity]] → [[89-cor-qml-not-axiomatizable]]"}],"outgoing":["ee07d81809d76030","7f53d84c2164d9c5","8811191242063297","15c083801acd41a1"]}